        "char_fairy_bai_qing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recovers part of a myriad eyes clear bull head from Falling Heavenly River. The bull’s skin is very rare and full of water path dao marks on the portion from the head that he has. Skin from the bull’s body would carry water path dao marks and light path dao marks as well, and that body skin is very useful for refining investigative Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "head-skin-and-body-skin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eye tattoos on the thick skin are how the myriad eyes clear bull truly perceives vision; its eyes themselves cannot see.",
